  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can discorporate into your swarm to avoid danger. When you take damage, you can take a Reaction to give yourself Resistance to that damage. You vanish into your swarm and then teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of you, where you reappear with it. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Wy4TM5F6Dl0h85j4\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Halve the damage yourself (Resistance).</p></section>",
